      "document_id": "bfa523d6243c45fc8eca7e7ea82dae4f",
      "source": "docker-acceptance-20261107.pdf",
      "chunk_id": 0,
      "content": "Orion RAG Deployment Acceptance Sample\nSynthetic test evidence for PDF ingestion and persistence.\nThe Orion launch code is RAG-PDF-7821.\nThe verification window is 47 minutes.\nThese are test labels, not production configuration.",
      "rank": 1,
      "score": 8.634111404418945,
      "page": 1
    },
    {
      "document_id": "base_5bb634d59b83bee6446dc5ecd0c6f429",
      "source": "knowledge.txt",
      "chunk_id": 0,
      "content": "RAG 是 Retrieval-Augmented Generation 的缩写，中文叫检索增强生成。它先从知识库中检索与用户问题相关的文本，再把这些文本交给大语言模型生成答案。\n\n文本切块会把长文档分成较短的 chunk。chunk 太大会混入过多无关内容，太小则可能破坏完整语义。相邻 chunk 可以保留少量重叠，避免关键信息刚好被切断。\n\nEmbedding 模型把文本转换成向量。语义相近的文本，其向量通常也更接近。本项目使用 BAAI/bge-small-zh-v1.5 和 sentence-transformers 生成向量。\n\n",
      "rank": 2,
      "score": -0.6523411273956299
    },
    {
      "document_id": "base_5bb634d59b83bee6446dc5ecd0c6f429",
      "source": "knowledge.txt",
      "chunk_id": 1,
      "content": "/bge-small-zh-v1.5 和 sentence-transformers 生成向量。\n\nFAISS 是一个向量检索库。IndexFlatIP 使用内积搜索；当文档向量和查询向量都经过 L2 归一化后，内积就等于余弦相似度。\n",
      "rank": 3,
      "score": -9.763107299804688
    }
  ]
}